        US prices, October 2026. The 512 GB M5 Ultra is expected above $10,000.
        DGX Station prices are set by OEM partners.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Fragment slot="notes">
      <p>The M5 Ultra has 1.2 TB/s at every memory size. More memory adds capacity, not speed.</p>
      <p>tinybox is made by tiny corp, the company behind tinygrad. Their red models use AMD cards and cost less.</p>
      <p>The DGX Station bandwidth figure is for its 252 GB of HBM. The other 496 GB is LPDDR5X at 396 GB/s.</p>
    </Fragment>
